  "_comment": "Factory defaults for study-session mode options. Edit a value here and rebuild; app/build.gradle.kts generates ModeOptionDefaults.kt from it (compile-time constants, no runtime cost). _options: every option's definition (name, type, default, and optional min/max/step for the UI). _modes: for each CATEGORY_MODE pair, a map of option id -> true/false. true entries keep their key order as display order for the generated UI list; false entries are never shown and may appear in any order. Every category sharing one mode (e.g. PRACTICE_LIST/QUIZ_LIST/GUIDED_LIST) must list the exact same set of keys \u2014 the codegen build step fails loudly if one doesn't, so an option can never silently vanish from a sibling. _overrides: for an _options field whose default genuinely differs by (category, mode) \u2014 keyed by field name, then by the CATEGORY_MODE key, to the overriding value; anything not listed there falls back to that field's plain default in _options.",
